.
.  Generate sample output for Power Lognormal PPF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na plnppf4.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE SIZE 6
TITLE OFFSET 3
LABEL SIZE 6
TIC LABEL SIZE 6
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL Probability
Y1LABEL X
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 13
FRAME CORNER COORDINATES 20 20 90 90
THICKNESS 0.2
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
TITLE Power Lognormal PPF (p = 0.5)
PLOT PLNPPF(P,0.5,1) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Power Lognormal PPF (p = 1)
PLOT PLNPPF(P,1,1) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Power Lognormal PPF (p = 5)
PLOT PLNPPF(P,5,1) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Power Lognormal PPF (p = 10)
PLOT PLNPPF(P,10,1) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system mv PLNPPF4.PS plnppf4.ps
.
quit
